{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11236290","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11236290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1123629001:1":{"text":"サイアン！大丈夫か？","source_cn":"萨恩！你没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA12210D62A18B4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1123629002:1":{"text":"ああ、もう平気だ！いまいましい虫どもめ、毛の間に潜り込んで出てこなくてさ！","source_cn":"已经没事了！都怪那群讨厌的小虫子，爬进毛里就不肯出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67AA9C58B4894177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123629003:1":{"text":"そいつは良かった。少し休んだら、試練を再開しよう。","source_cn":"那就好。我们休息一阵，再继续完成试炼吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C607AE7618F10D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1123629004:1":{"text":"ええ！？ケガをしてるのに、まだ試練を続けるんですか？","source_cn":"哎？！你们都受伤了，还要继续试炼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61FB24D31A4A550C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123629005:1":{"text":"試練でケガするのは普通だろ？実力を測るための試練なんだから！","source_cn":"在试炼中受伤不是常事吗！否则怎么考验我们的实力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F00265B51747F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1123629006:1":{"text":"たとえ試練で命を落としても悔いはない！それが試練ってもんだからな！","source_cn":"就算是死于试炼之中，我们也绝无怨言！这就是试炼的意义！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB283D119C5DF7B53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士扎尔坦":{"text":"戦士ザルタン","source":"战士扎尔坦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:战士萨恩":{"text":"戦士サイアン","source":"战士萨恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}